        "authority": "AUTHORITATIVE_CURRENT",
        "sourceText": "Captain Titus, Righteous Fury Ability\nChange to:\n‘In the Fight phase, you can use this ability. If you do, this unit’s melee\nattacks have +1 S, and when this unit has fought:\n▪ This model heals D3 wounds.\n▪ Or: If this model destroyed an enemy model this phase, this model\nheals 2D3 wounds.’"
      },
